		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>Voici mes configurations de logs :</p><p>log_destination = &#039;stderr&#039;<br />logging_collector = on<br />#log_directory = &#039;pg_log&#039;<br />#log_directory = &#039;pg_log&#039;<br />#log_file_mode = 0600<br />#log_truncate_on_rotation = off&#160; &#160; <br />#log_rotation_age = 1d<br />log_rotation_size = 5MB</p><p>Merci pour votre aide.</p>]]></content>
